<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 3.06 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 3.06 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 3.06 percent on Thursday from 2.88 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said eight banks traded on the market in 23 reported transactions with a total value of 30.05 million dinars ($42.4 million).</p>
<p>Jordan's 21 private banks were closed on Wednesday to mark Christmas.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
